# English normalization (opt-in): rewrites what the tokenizer interns, so
# it changes the token stream every model is built from -- omit this file to
# reproduce results measured without normalization.
# A norm| rule must not map a negator onto its affirmative form, or it would
# erase the polarity the negate| rules detect after encoding.
# Grammar: norm|from|to
norm|isn|is not
norm|wasn|was not
norm|aren|are not
norm|weren|were not
norm|doesn|does not
norm|didn|did not
norm|don|do not
norm|couldn|could not
norm|wouldn|would not
norm|shouldn|should not
norm|hasn|has not
norm|haven|have not
norm|won|will not
